---
import FormatShowcase from './FormatShowcase.astro';
import InputError from './InputError.astro';
import EntryPoints from './EntryPoints.astro';
---
<div class="iris-home grid grid-cols-1 min-w-0 gap-14 py-8 text-iris-ink">
  <FormatShowcase />
  <InputError />
  <EntryPoints />
  <div class="border-t border-iris-border pt-6 text-sm text-iris-muted">
    <p>Iris grew out of Gecode’s instance reader. Iris 0.1 follows the language of Gecode 6.5.0, with the deliberate differences listed in the <a class="text-iris-link underline underline-offset-4" href="/specification/0.1/">Iris Language Specification</a>. <a class="text-iris-link underline underline-offset-4" href="/using/rust/">Rust</a> is the reference implementation.</p>
    <p class="mt-3"><a class="text-iris-link underline underline-offset-4" href="/examples/GECODE-LICENSE.md">Reader spec source notices</a></p>
  </div>
</div>
